      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "\n{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"companyName\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Name of the seller or invoice issuer. Null if missing.\"\n    },\n    \"invoiceNumber\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Invoice number explicitly shown in the document. Never invent.\"\n    },\n    \"poNumber\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Purchase Order number explicitly stated under PO No., Purchase Order No., or Buyer's Order No. Return null if blank, missing or unclear. NEVER fabricate a PO number or copy an invoice/reference number.\"\n    },\n    \"invoiceDate\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Invoice date in YYYY-MM-DD format. Null if unavailable.\"\n    },\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"List of distinct invoice products. Do not duplicate items from duplicate invoice copies.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"productName\": {\n            \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n            \"description\": \"Product name as stated in the invoice.\"\n          },\n          \"quantity\": {\n            \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n            \"description\": \"Numeric product quantity.\"\n          },\n          \"unit\": {\n            \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n            \"description\": \"Unit of measurement such as pcs, pairs, kg or nos.\"\n          },\n          \"unitPrice\": {\n            \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n            \"description\": \"Price per unit, excluding GST unless otherwise specified.\"\n          },\n          \"totalPrice\": {\n            \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n            \"description\": \"Line item amount as stated, or calculated from explicit quantity and unit price when unambiguous.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"productName\",\n          \"quantity\",\n          \"unit\",\n          \"unitPrice\",\n          \"totalPrice\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    },\n    \"subtotal\": {\n      \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Total taxable amount before GST. Null if unavailable.\"\n    },\n    \"gst\": {\n      \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Total GST amount. Add CGST and SGST, or use IGST as applicable. Never double-count taxes. Null if undeterminable.\"\n    },\n    \"grandTotal\": {\n      \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Final payable invoice amount including taxes and applicable charges.\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Three-letter currency code such as INR, USD or EUR. Null if unknown.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"companyName\",\n    \"invoiceNumber\",\n    \"poNumber\",\n    \"invoiceDate\",\n    \"items\",\n    \"subtotal\",\n    \"gst\",\n    \"grandTotal\",\n    \"currency\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}\n",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You are an invoice data extraction assistant.\n\nExtract invoice information from the provided PDF text into the exact Structured Output Parser schema.\n\nInvoice formats vary by sender. Identify fields by their meaning, not their position or layout.\n\nRules:\n1. Extract companyName (seller), invoiceNumber, poNumber, invoiceDate, items, subtotal, gst, grandTotal and currency.\n2. For each item extract productName, quantity, unit, unitPrice and totalPrice.\n3. Calculate total GST = CGST + SGST, or use IGST if applicable. Sum tax components only once. If total GST is explicitly provided, use it without double-counting.\n4. Use explicit invoice values. Calculate missing amounts only when all required values are available and the calculation is unambiguous.\n5. Convert dates to YYYY-MM-DD and monetary amounts to numbers.\n6. Return actual null for missing or uncertain values. Never guess, assume or fabricate data.\n7. If no items are found, return an empty items array.\n8. If the document contains Original/Duplicate/Triplicate copies of the same invoice, extract only once.\n\n9. STRICT PO NUMBER EXTRACTION:\n\nExtract poNumber ONLY when an explicit Purchase Order number is present in the invoice.\n\nLook for labels such as \"PO Number\", \"PO No.\", \"Purchase Order No.\" or \"Buyer's Order No.\"\n\nIf the field is blank, missing or unclear, return JSON null.\n\nNEVER generate, predict or fabricate a PO number.\n\nNEVER use invoice numbers, reference numbers or delivery note numbers as PO numbers.\n\nA missing PO number is completely valid and must remain null.\n\nExample: \"poNumber\": null\n10. Follow the output schema exactly. Return only structured JSON, without explanations."
        }
      },
